      "writtenOn": "2020-02-25T06:32:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Scenarious:\nAs this issue (https://partnerissuetracker.corp.google.com/issues/146318582) . when one CC is open, the other CC is Ra, TCPM set Look4Connection command to toggle CC under normal mode (Don`t enter Low Power mode), but ANX7447/ANX3447 can not enter CC toggle process if CABLE_DET_DEG is not configured as \"0\".\n\nChip Behaviors: \nthere are two conditions to toggle CC pins through Look4Connection under normal mode, those are almost like the below.\nif(CABLE_DET_DEG \u003d\u003d 0 \u0026\u0026 Look4Connection)\n{\n  config CC pins to toggle;\n} \nNote: \n      CABLE_DET_DEG: it is a degital signal, and be configured by register 0xAA:bit6;\n      Look4Connection: configure the Look4Connection command;\n\nwhen this issue (146318582) occurs, look4Connection_command is \"1\", so CABLE_DET_DEG shall be configured to \"0\" to start the CC toggling; Once CC is connection, CABLE_DET_DEG shall be configured to \"1\" to stop the CC toggling.",
      "parentUuid": "e09de042_340c23f5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 8,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 34
      },
